Z||000000||FOCOSEVA||06-20-2001||12:02 AM||||<BR>2001 Fiero Festival main hotel cutoff date <BR>Folks, if you're staying at the Ramada Inn for the 2001 FOCOA Fiero Festival <BR>in Williamsburg, Va., be aware that the cutoff date for making your <BR>reservations is Monday, July 2, 2001. After that date the hotel is going to <BR>release any and all of the remaining unreserved Fiero-block rooms to the <BR>general public. Call 1-800-666-8888 to reserve your room, and tell the <BR>reservation clerk you're with the national Fiero group so you will get the <BR>discounted room rate. <BR>CaptFiero@aol.com<BR>fieroharry@yahoo.com||||reg||4
